<section class="pub-section capability-stage">
  <div class="pub-section__heading pub-section__heading--row"><div><span class="pub-kicker">What it actually handles</span><h2>The operational middle—not just the stock count.</h2></div><a class="pub-text-link" href="/capabilities">Explore every capability <span>→</span></a></div>
  <div class="capability-grid">
    <article class="capability-card capability-card--wide"><span class="capability-card__number">01</span><div><small>INVENTORY TRUTH</small><h3>Know what is on hand, available, committed and incoming.</h3><p>Variants, lots, serials, kits, counts, corrections and a ledger that explains every balance.</p></div><div class="mini-ledger"><span>On hand <b>31</b></span><span>Committed <b>18</b></span><span>Available <b>13</b></span><span>Incoming <b>24</b></span></div></article>
    <article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">02</span><small>BUY &amp; MOVE</small><h3>Replenishment, POs and transfers</h3><p>Case packs, supplier terms, lead time, existing incoming stock and multi-location availability.</p><div class="decision-chip"><i></i> Transfer is faster than buying</div></article>
    <article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">03</span><small>SELL &amp; FULFIL</small><h3>Customer orders kept moving</h3><p>Commit inventory, surface shortages, fulfill partially, ship, collect and process returns.</p><div class="order-line"><span>SO-2088</span><b>Ready to ship</b></div></article>
    <article class="capability-card capability-card--ink"><span class="capability-card__number">04</span><small>UNDERSTAND &amp; RESPOND</small><h3>Business communication becomes operational evidence.</h3><p>Supplier replies, invoices, shipment notices and customer questions are connected to the records they concern.</p><div class="email-snippet"><span>ABC Apparel</span><p>We can ship 24 Thursday. New unit cost is $14.98.</p><b>ETA updated · price exception created</b></div></article>
    <article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">05</span><small>MONEY</small><h3>Payments and books follow the operation</h3><p>Receivables, payables, inventory valuation, COGS and evidence-backed reporting.</p><div class="money-row"><span>Order paid</span><b>+$1,000</b></div></article>
  </div>
</section>

