<section class="pub-section switching-section"><div><span class="pub-kicker">Switch without blind trust</span><h2>Bring the records. Review the truth. Then turn it on.</h2><p>Start with a spreadsheet or supported system. StockChief previews mappings, identifies ambiguity, reconciles totals and requires approval before imported records become operational truth.</p><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/switching">How switching works</a></div><div class="import-visual"><div class="import-file"><span>XL</span><div><b>opening-inventory.xlsx</b><small>2,846 rows · 4 locations</small></div><i>read</i></div><div class="import-checks"><p><i>✓</i><span><b>2,841</b> records matched</span></p><p><i>!</i><span><b>5</b> need clarification</span></p><p><i>✓</i><span><b>$428,610</b> source total reconciled</span></p></div><div class="import-ready"><i></i><span><b>Nothing changes until approval</b><small>Preview can be cancelled or corrected</small></span></div></div></section>

